# Local docs/prototypes
# Both casings — macOS filesystem is case-insensitive but EAS Build upload
# enforces case-sensitivity and flags these files as casing conflicts if
# only one casing is ignored. See: https://expo.fyi/macos-ignorecase
Financial_Analysis.html
MotoVault-*.html
MotoVault-*.md
motovault-*.html
motovault-*.md
